# KDOS — logic analysers, scopes, meters and supplies driven by sigrok.
#
# libsigrok's 60-libsigrok.rules marks every device one of its drivers
# supports with ENV{ID_SIGROK}="1" and grants nothing; this is the grant. The
# mark is upstream's list, so a device libsigrok learns to drive is covered
# when libsigrok is updated, with no table here to fall behind it.
#
# An FX2 analyser re-enumerates after libsigrok uploads fx2lafw to it, and
# comes back under a new id that the same list marks, so both halves of that
# dance are reachable by the console user.

ENV{ID_SIGROK}=="1", GROUP="dialout", MODE="0660"
